# Environment variables added to every job. One KEY=VALUE per line.
# Changes apply to new jobs after: docker compose restart
#
# Gitea has a built-in package registry (PyPI, npm, NuGet, Maven, ...). Point
# the toolchains at it, or at any other mirror inside the air gap:
#
# PIP_INDEX_URL=http://gitea.example.internal:3000/api/packages/ORG/pypi/simple
# NPM_CONFIG_REGISTRY=http://gitea.example.internal:3000/api/packages/ORG/npm/
